WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.251
Brad: This is terrible!

2
00:00:15.252 --> 00:00:18.191
Tina: We shouldn’t have left Bello alone!

3
00:00:18.192 --> 00:00:20.628
Danny: We have to chase after him.

4
00:00:20.629 --> 00:00:26.938
Tina: But how? The evil creatures are flying too fast.

5
00:00:26.939 --> 00:00:33.188
Brad: Maybe something in the house can help us.

6
00:00:33.189 --> 00:00:36.767
Brad: Look. It’s Bello’s toy car and toy horse.

7
00:00:36.768 --> 00:00:38.924
Danny: How can we use those?

8
00:00:38.925 --> 00:00:41.298
Tina: If only they were real!

9
00:00:41.299 --> 00:00:46.282
Danny: That’s it! They are as real as we can imagine them!

10
00:00:46.283 --> 00:00:49.020
Tina: Do you really think we can make them real?

11
00:00:49.021 --> 00:00:50.728
Danny: It’s worth a try.

12
00:00:50.729 --> 00:00:53.747
Come on, everybody hold hands.

13
00:00:53.748 --> 00:00:58.994
Danny: Imagine the fastest horse you can and the quickest car in the world.

14
00:00:58.995 --> 00:01:11.641
Brad: Concentrate with all your might!

15
00:01:11.642 --> 00:01:15.120
Tina: We did it!

16
00:01:15.121 --> 00:01:16.982
Danny: Good work, guys!

17
00:01:16.983 --> 00:01:19.845
Okay, who is going to drive?

18
00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:23.568
Brad: Have you seen me play Race Car Challenge on my computer?

19
00:01:23.569 --> 00:01:28.869
Brad: I’m the best!

20
00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.356
Tina: I’ve always wanted to ride a horse.

21
00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:34.330
Besides I think she likes me.

22
00:01:34.331 --> 00:01:36.282
Danny: Okay, you ride.

23
00:01:36.283 --> 00:01:39.487
I’ll go with Brad.

24
00:01:39.488 --> 00:01:52.316
Tina: Now let’s go get Bello!

25
00:01:52.317 --> 00:01:55.656
Brad: Wait! Which way did they go?

26
00:01:55.657 --> 00:01:57.764
Danny: They went that way!

27
00:01:57.765 --> 00:02:00.366
Tina: They went that way!

28
00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:06.292
Brad: You two seem a little confused.

29
00:02:06.293 --> 00:02:08.163
Tina: What are you doing?

30
00:02:08.164 --> 00:02:10.817
Brad: I’m using my computer to find Bello.

31
00:02:10.818 --> 00:02:15.662
Brad: When we stood in the backyard, Bello’s shadow [n3@passed right over the chimney.

32
00:02:15.663 --> 00:02:21.228
Brad: That could tell me where they went.

33
00:02:21.229 --> 00:02:23.449
Brad: I’ve got it! I’ll lead.

34
00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:29.156
Tina, you follow me!

35
00:02:29.157 --> 00:02:32.996
Danny: Look out!

36
00:02:32.997 --> 00:02:38.879
Brad: Hold on!

37
00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:44.783
Danny: That was close!

38
00:02:44.784 --> 00:02:50.882
Tina: That’s a good girl!

39
00:02:50.883 --> 00:02:54.697
Brad: Here we go!

40
00:02:54.698 --> 00:03:04.890
Tina: You can do it, girl!

41
00:03:04.891 --> 00:03:08.225
Danny: Look, we’ve almost caught up to them!

42
00:03:08.226 --> 00:03:10.114
Brad: Keep up with me, Tina.

43
00:03:10.115 --> 00:03:12.841
Just a little faster.

44
00:03:12.842 --> 00:03:16.252
Tina: Come on, girl!

45
00:03:16.253 --> 00:03:18.711
Tina: They’re heading toward the mountain.

46
00:03:18.712 --> 00:03:23.187
Brad: We have to keep up with them.

47
00:03:23.188 --> 00:03:29.740
Danny: Rocks! Rocks! Stop!

48
00:03:29.741 --> 00:03:33.236
Tina: We’re stuck!
